   (a) Review. View, read, inspect, build and test the Software, and let
       Your Personnel do so for You, to evaluate it and to audit its
       security and behaviour.

   (b) Run. Install and run the Software, including in production, solely
       to connect to RecoilPay for Your Operations.

   (c) Configure. Create and change the configuration files the Software
       reads (for example config.yaml and its secrets), to run it under (b).

   (d) Build an adapter. Write a separate program that connects the Software
       to Your own payout rails through the adapter protocol described in
       docs/adapters.md. You may copy and adapt the code in examples/adapter
       for that purpose. Such an adapter may be used only with the Software
       under (b).

